#: src/ui/SettingsScreen.cpp
msgid ""
"40 fps is requested instead of the frame-rate selection. Uncheck to restore "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Se solicitan 40 fps en lugar de la velocidad de fotogramas seleccionada. "
"Desmárcala para volver a esa selección."

#: src/ui/SettingsScreen.cpp
msgid ""
"40 fps is not in the detected list. Start checks whether the driver accepts "
